# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Keep the build context clean — dependencies and build artifacts are (re)generated
# inside the image (bun install, vendor:ffmpeg, bun run build). Mirrors what DO App
# Platform builds from a fresh git checkout.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
# Vendored ffmpeg.wasm runtime (~32MB) — copied from node_modules at build time.
apps/*/public/vendor
# `**/` because the Rust build output lives at apps/desktop/src-tauri/target,
# and a bare `target` matches only the repo root. Unignored it is ~7.7 GB of local
# build artifacts shipped into every build context — invisible in CI and on App
# Platform, which build from a fresh checkout, but enough to make "just build the
# image locally to check it" impractical, which is the loop this repo now depends on.
**/target
# Local dev object storage (~295 MB, gitignored). Same reasoning as target.
content
*.log
.env
.env.*
data
